Error: Jet.UnknownInterpolationSelector: Unknown interpolation selector `:Repr`
  --> Tests/UI/debug_unknown_selector.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     print("{x:Repr}")
    |               ^^^^
 Why: `:Repr` calls `repr` of trait `ReprFormat`, and no trait of that name is in scope here
 Fix: Use a Core selector such as `:Debug`, `:Pretty`, `:Fixed(n)`, `:Hex(n)`, `:Pad(n)` or `:Unit(name)`, import or declare `ReprFormat`, or write `{value}`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnknownInterpolationSelector
